Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.39,0:00:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man. Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We seem to be heading toward that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we arrive in Egypt,\Nwe need to make a slight detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone is waiting for us on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.51,0:00:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a man who is extremely\Nimportant to our journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does someone actually live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is such a tiny little\Nisland, it's practically deserted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have to agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.47,0:00:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, are you sure\Nsomeone actually lives here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been living on\Nthis island by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man told me back in India, and\NI'm sure I heard him correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.59,0:00:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you say, a man... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mangoes from India?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.88,0:02:42.47,Title 3,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\pos(192,810)}Episode 21: Judgement, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to interrupt,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I thought you should know someone's\Nwatching us from the grass over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the back, he looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:02:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry, Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mixed in those shells you love, so make\Nsure you share with the others, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's lots more\Nwhere this came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to get nice and fat so\Nyou'll be a tasty chicken, Lionel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.57,0:03:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be. It's... Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go and talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of you just wait here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, my name is Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends and I are currently\Ntraveling on an expedition to Egypt...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.57,0:03:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His voice sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one ever comes to see me when\Nthey have actual good news to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only get visitors when\Nsomething bad happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, wait! I said go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His father?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He withdrew from society and\Nlives alone on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I wasn't able\Nto tell you about this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it ever became known to\NDio that we stopped at this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdahl's father would\Nbe put in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.11,0:04:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never forgive\Nmyself if that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now, my focus has to be on\Ntelling him what every parent fears most.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That his son is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull the rift!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let yourself go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol's death wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's entirely my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry that burden\Nfor as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it safe to assume his\Nfather's a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't know what kind of stand\Nit is or what sort of power it wields.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by the way his\Nfather reacted to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt he'll offer us much\Nin the way of assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just leave the\Ntalking to me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.93,0:05:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully my words will\Nbe able to reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:06:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ever wanted was to avenge my sister's\Ndeath, and I ended up killing my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I could possibly\Ndo to make it up to his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is pretty shiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it drifted\Nup from some sunken ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at all those barnacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely made of metal, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some kind of\Ncreepy face carved on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite that, it looks pretty valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if I can scratch off these\Nbarnacles, we'll really be in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
