Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.51,0:06:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world happened just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the air trapped inside just burst\Nout and I was scared over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I'm not dealing with\NAladdin's magic lamp or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I guess I can relax a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get three!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.99,0:07:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wish is my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three wishes for whatever\Nyour heart desires!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of fresh hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am known as Cameo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to thank you for\Nfreeing me from the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me your three wishes so\Nthat I might grant them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you smoky freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a new stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.81,0:07:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's not half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What awesome power!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.31,0:07:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen buddy, your strength tells me\Nthat your user is definitely nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like the answer to that question
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be considered as your\Nfirst official wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little on the\Nboring side if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't pull that genie in a\Nbottle crap with me, fisher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're saying you could make me\Na super rich man right this instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your first wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and grant it if you can, but\Notherwise stop jerking me around, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.97,0:08:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then consider your wish granted. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail to you!
