Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand a single\Nthing that just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that strange guy wasn't\Nthe enemy's stand after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd attack me, but instead\Nhe told me to make three wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:09:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on\Nhere, but I don't trust that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone shady is on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably a good idea to tell Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There might be a chance it could have\Nsomething to do with Avdol's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with all that\Nloud clanging back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.85,0:09:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is this for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.35,0:09:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is gold from\Nthe Napoleonic era!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a dream or an illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.91,0:09:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A treasure Drive of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't believe it\Nif it wasn't right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be mocking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.93,0:09:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When could he have buried this gold here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.27,0:09:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he would have had\Ntime to bury it after I made my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how the hell did\Nthat freak do all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what is your second wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wish is my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you scheming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think I'd fall\Nfor your stupid tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are my enemy,\Nthen fight me like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.49,0:10:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, I'll take this\Ntreasure for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I take it knowing the answer to\Nthat question is your second wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it's a little on the\Nboring side if you ask me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I owe you a debt of gratitude\Nfor letting me out of that lamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I shall grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you're a smug bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then, have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do have a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be a comic artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was always my dream\Nback when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't make me some\Npathetic one either!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be bigger than Disney!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, someday I'm gonna\Nbuild my own Polnareff land!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Y-you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scratch that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a second to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any minute now, it'll come to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a beautiful girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than money or fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want is true love!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking not only\Nsomeone who's really cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a girl who wore pinkies for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she loves me with all her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to meet a girl who feels the\Nsame way about me as I do for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if that's within your power to do,\Nthen prove it to me right now, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want a girl, do you? Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need time to think this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have the ability to revive someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I to assume you're wanting to know the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.01,0:11:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,answer to that question\Nis your second wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:12:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to bring my\Ndead sister back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it, you can\Ndo the same for my friend Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shouldn't be too much\Nof a challenge, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
