Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.02,Eyecatch3 - Top,sign bot,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\shad4\4a&HFF&\pos(1277.6,790)}Jean Pierre Polnareff
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can really... do it? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But know that since you made two wishes,\NI'll grant them in the order you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I will grant your second\Nwish to bring back your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.63,0:12:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hail to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:13:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you and\Nwhy are you even doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I heard\Nsomething rustling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like someone\Nwas digging up the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.47,0:13:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's that weird digging again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that sound coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that a woman crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, who the hell's back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are strands of hair,\Nand a woman's hair no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman's footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way this can't\Nbe happening, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my little sister is still in her coffin\Nback in France, so how could she be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better answer me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body hasn't fully formed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.39,0:15:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff's been gone a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't find him up top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already nightfall and\Nhe's nowhere to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that he could have gotten\Ntangled up in a fight with the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry, am I hallucinating\Nor is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Cherry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Cherry, it's only me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cherry, why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Cherry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you to show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see it one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:15:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higher, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise me as high as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now spin me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's simply wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting a new umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for buying it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkyu, what the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been half eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.11,0:16:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, your older brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because my body is covered in mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.39,0:17:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so unkempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to believe me when I\Nsay you're perfect as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.07,0:17:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying you'll hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:18:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sherry, have I ever said anything\Nto make you think I'd hate you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was when we were little kids and I gave
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your favorite tropical\Nfish to that stupid cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got really angry over\Nit and said you hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit I was angry that\Nday, but no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always loved you more\Nthan the stars in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've always loved me,\Nno matter what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.65,0:18:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And does that feeling\Nhold true to this day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will always love you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can clearly see now\Nthat you're the real Sherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how much I've\Nmissed you, little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the same, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sherry, please look this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.95,0:18:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you to show me\Nthat beautiful face of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying, Cherry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.97,0:18:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still sad? Sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:18:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are tears of sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm crying because...\NWhat? What is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.07,0:19:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I can finally hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ch-Cherry Dunn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.81,0:19:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ch-Cherry Dunn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I bit you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid my body is\Nstill underdeveloped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I eat your flesh,\NI'll return to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay if I eat you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always did what I asked you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cameo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rang?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a complaint?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I granted your wish, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granting wishes is my power after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you do with them\Nis completely up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let me use this opportunity\Nto tell you my third wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make my sister return to her\Ngrave so she can rest in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:20:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:21:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it, do you, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you haven't figured\Nit out, I'm a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just any stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one represented by the judgment card.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my powers allow me to extract wishes from\Nthe deepest corners of the human mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and manifest it from the soil below.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You created your sister\Nfrom your own yearning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since you created\Nher, I cannot undo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.15,0:21:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the winner\Nof this battle is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I seem to recall you\Nsaying something about a third wish.
