Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.85,0:21:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't you remember, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.69,0:21:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already made\Nyour third wish. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.81,0:22:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.57,0:22:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.61,0:22:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.22,0:22:15.64,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.64,0:22:17.89,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.89,0:22:19.35,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got their money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.15,0:22:22.61,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.99,0:22:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.61,0:22:24.94,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.94,0:22:27.28,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.57,0:22:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tight to the hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.28,0:22:28.78,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.45,0:22:31.91,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.91,0:22:34.12,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.13,0:22:43.67,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take their trays.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.55,0:22:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.06,0:22:57.52,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:22:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop, you drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.52,0:22:59.89,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.03,0:22:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they bring you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids are sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.89,0:23:01.15,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.85,0:23:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.19,0:23:04.52,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.91,0:23:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.52,0:23:06.86,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.39,0:23:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.86,0:23:09.20,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.15,0:23:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say. Walk
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.20,0:23:10.66,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.49,0:23:13.83,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.83,0:23:16.04,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a man uncovers his deepest desires.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.17,0:23:26.25,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of his weaknesses are laid bare.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.51,0:23:29.51,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.79,0:23:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of your idiotic, bumbling eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I truly didn't\Nthink you'd be this hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.57,0:23:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get better if I eat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.99,0:23:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it was only the third wish.
